{"2654990": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mythic Love: Iberian Legends", "steam_appid": 2654990, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654990/extras/d3dd0c02969d24639542e230334d464d.avif?t=1782249034\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654990/extras_big/d3dd0c02969d24639542e230334d464d.avif?t=1782249034 width=1560 height=420 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mythic Love: Iberian Legends</strong> is a fun monster romance visual novel inspired by Spanish myths and legends! Flirt with Iberian folklore creatures, save (or doom) humanity, and, if you earn their trust, unlock <strong>their true monstrous form!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet five romanceable myths, each with their own drama, secrets, and a tendency to snack on humans from time to time ;). Your choices decide whether you end up in love, betrayed, or just… obliterated. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >   Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Five romanceable Iberian legends</strong> – from mischievous gods to broody monsters. Flirt at your own risk.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock their true monster forms</strong> – if they trust you enough. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>30+ endings</strong> – happy, tragic, weird… and a few you’ll probably regret.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices that matter</strong> – decide who to trust, who to love, and whether humanity survives your love life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20+ hours of story content</strong> – A 300,000-word adventure with five romance routes, each offering around 4 hours of story content.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654990/extras/c09fa853ebcdf37ee50e443acf54ef1f.avif?t=1782249034\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654990/extras_big/c09fa853ebcdf37ee50e443acf54ef1f.avif?t=1782249034 width=1560 height=424 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654990/extras/d3dd0c02969d24639542e230334d464d.avif?t=1782249034\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654990/extras_big/d3dd0c02969d24639542e230334d464d.avif?t=1782249034 width=1560 height=420 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mythic Love: Iberian Legends</strong> is a fun monster romance visual novel inspired by Spanish myths and legends! Flirt with Iberian folklore creatures, save (or doom) humanity, and, if you earn their trust, unlock <strong>their true monstrous form!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet five romanceable myths, each with their own drama, secrets, and a tendency to snack on humans from time to time ;). Your choices decide whether you end up in love, betrayed, or just… obliterated. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >   Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Five romanceable Iberian legends</strong> – from mischievous gods to broody monsters. Flirt at your own risk.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock their true monster forms</strong> – if they trust you enough. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>30+ endings</strong> – happy, tragic, weird… and a few you’ll probably regret.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices that matter</strong> – decide who to trust, who to love, and whether humanity survives your love life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20+ hours of story content</strong> – A 300,000-word adventure with five romance routes, each offering around 4 hours of story content.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654990/extras/c09fa853ebcdf37ee50e443acf54ef1f.avif?t=1782249034\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654990/extras_big/c09fa853ebcdf37ee50e443acf54ef1f.avif?t=1782249034 width=1560 height=424 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Think you can handle a little romance with creatures from Spanish folklore? ❤️‍🔥 Careful: your love life isn’t the only thing at stake at Mythic Love: Iberian Legends.", "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654990/ca74b4a2fd4c96de05727025bc15f1a53ad9bb54/header.jpg?t=1782249034", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654990/e05d3bff6b942cfc2ab06b607d8e4a6bfe192207/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782249034", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654990/e05d3bff6b942cfc2ab06b607d8e4a6bfe192207/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782249034", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7, Windows 10 and Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1024 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.15 Catalina or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 or Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1024 MB RAM<br></li>